- Unified card hover: lift + shadow across all card types
- Image zoom-on-hover in card shells (disabled under `prefers-reduced-motion`)
- **Accent system:** `.accent` / `.accent--deep` in headlines; `.headline-rule` (48px orange bar) under section titles — same motif on testimonial card tops
- **Numbered editorial rows:** Barlow Condensed index numerals (`01 ·`, `02`–`04`) on Haas features band + news secondary items
- **Photo cards:** 105° left gradient + optional bottom scrim (hero, CTA, `.news-feature` lead)
- **Inverted light bands:** white bg + dark ink text (Haas features band `7080:2240`) — not dark-on-dark for multi-column capability grids
- **Haas watermark:** static, intro-only, layered via `.haas-relationship__bg` / `__content` — no parallax

**17 Unsplash stand-in images** placed across hero, intro, machine panels, testimonials, and news sections.

