## Tech Stack

- Pure HTML5 / CSS3 (custom properties) / vanilla JS (ES6) — zero frameworks
- Fonts: Barlow Condensed (Google Fonts) for display + Navigo (Adobe Fonts, kit `lqh7ybe`) — 400 + 700 for body/UI
- CSS load order: `assets/css/tokens.css` → `assets/css/components.css` → `assets/css/layout.css` → `assets/css/elevated.css`
- JS: `nav.js` (sticky, mobile, search modal, signup), `slider.js`, `filter.js`, `animations.js`, `machine-tabs.js`, `modal.js` (legacy `testimonials.js` removed — grid partial does not use carousel)

## Typography System (2026-08-17)

- **Display:** Barlow Condensed (`--font-display`, Google Fonts 500/600/700) — section titles, card titles, stat numerals, testimonial names, news index numerals
- **Body/UI:** Navigo (`--font-sans`, Adobe kit `lqh7ybe`) — paragraphs, labels, buttons, eyebrows
- **The Adobe Fonts kit serves Navigo 400 + 700** (plus italics). Tokens map `--fw-medium` / `--fw-semibold` to **500** — add Medium to kit for UI labels; until then 500 falls back to 400. Do not use 600/800 unless added to kit.
- Type scale lives in tokens.css: `--fs-hero/display/h1/h2/h3/h4/stat` (fluid clamps — do NOT re-override sizes in media queries) + `--fs-lede/body/ui/caption`. Tracking: `--ls-hero…h4` (negative, tightens with size), `--ls-caps` 0.14em (eyebrows), `--ls-meta` 0.08em (card labels). Leading: `--lh-*`.
- All headlines use scale tokens + `text-wrap: balance`; body/quotes use `--lh-body` and `text-wrap: pretty`; intro body capped at 62ch measure.
- Buttons: `text-transform: uppercase` + 0.05em letter-spacing, `--fw-bold` (maps to Navigo 700)

## Key Brand Tokens
- Orange: `#F38A2C` (`--clr-orange`)
- Dark bg: `#1C1C21` (`--clr-dark-bg`)
- Dark nav/footer: `#3A3A40` (`--clr-dark-nav`)
- Body gray: `#6B6B76` (`--clr-gray-body`)
- Border: `#E4E4EA` (`--clr-gray-border`)
- Max-width: 1200px (homepage) / 1120px (ES page)
- Radii: buttons 8px, cards 0 (squared), pills 99px

